                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Command Browser &amp; Keybind Manager:</Run>
                                Browse, edit, test, and bind Rust console commands and convars with built-in parameter guidance and key capture.
                            </TextBlock>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Live Item Suggestion Popout:</Run>
                                Floating in-game suggestion window with live item autocomplete and parameter completion for rapid command entry.
                            </TextBlock>

                            <!-- Team Base Codes -->
                            <TextBlock Text="🔑 Team Base Codes" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="14" Margin="0,8,0,6" Foreground="{DynamicResource Accent}"/>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Shared Door &amp; Base Codes:</Run>
                                Centralized Base Codes vault allowing teams to organize door codes, airlock PINs, etc, with sharing directly to team chat via !code.
                            </TextBlock>

                            <!-- CCTV Cameras -->
                            <TextBlock Text="📹 CCTV Cameras Rebuilt" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="14" Margin="0,8,0,6" Foreground="{DynamicResource Accent}"/>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Native Camera Engine:</Run>
                                Camera streaming, controlling, and rendering were rebuilt from scratch on the native Rust+ camera API, removing the external Node.js process entirely for lower latency, lower memory use, and faster startup.
                            </TextBlock>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Multiple Live Cameras:</Run>
                                Open several camera windows at the same time &#x2014; each one streams over its own dedicated connection.
                            </TextBlock>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Analog Joystick Control:</Run>
                                A draggable joystick replaces the arrow pad. Look and drone-movement speed scale with how far you push the ball, giving fine control near the center and fast sweeps at the edge.
                            </TextBlock>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Capability-Aware Fluent HUD:</Run>
                                The camera window is a premium Fluent design that auto-detects drones, auto-turrets, PTZ, and static cameras, showing only the movement, mouse-look, zoom, fire, and reload controls each one actually supports.
                            </TextBlock>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Add, Name, Edit &amp; Delete Cameras:</Run>
                                Manage cameras from a responsive full-width list with inline popovers &#x2014; add cameras with optional friendly display names, rename their identifier, and delete them, all saved per server.
                            </TextBlock>

                            <!-- Cloud Platform & Connection Resilience -->
                            <TextBlock Text="🛡️ Cloud Platform &amp; Connection Resilience" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="14" Margin="0,8,0,6" Foreground="{DynamicResource Accent}"/>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Next-Gen Cloud Platform:</Run>
                                Migrated backend services to a unified Cloud platform for enhanced reliability, realtime sync, and streamlined role entitlements.
                            </TextBlock>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Access Denied &amp; HTTP 418 Handling:</Run>
                                Intelligent detection of expired server credentials or revoked pairings with clear re-pairing prompts and responsive layout.
                            </TextBlock>
                            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                <Run FontWeight="Bold">&#x2022; Startup Diagnostics &amp; Internationalization:</Run>
                                Added startup crash telemetry diagnostics, resolved compiler warnings, and completed translation of internal services, comments, and logging to English.
                            </TextBlock>

